# macOS -exported_symbols_list allowlist for the ANGLE dylibs. Only the public
# EGL/GLES entry points (egl*/gl*) and the EGL_ dispatch entry points that the
# libEGL loader dlsyms out of libGLESv2 are exposed; every internal symbol is
# hidden from the dynamic export table. GL_* is ANGLE's internal GL dispatch, not
# the GLES ABI and not dlsym'd by the loader, so it is deliberately NOT exported.
# Applied to both dylibs; patterns that match nothing in one are harmless.
_egl*
_gl*
_EGL_*
